<h1>Average 40-Yard Dash for a <em>16 Year Old</em></h1>
<div class="hero-meta">
<span class="hero-meta-item">📊 Sprint Speed · Age 16</span>
<span class="hero-meta-item">🏈 Football · Recruiting</span>
<span class="hero-meta-item">📅 Updated July 2026</span>
</div>
<p class="hero-intro">
    The average 40-yard dash for a 16-year-old male is 5.2 to 5.6 seconds. For females it is 5.8 to 6.4 seconds. Sophomore year is when recruiting attention starts to build — here is exactly what counts as average, good, and elite, what scouts are watching for at 16, and why this age is one of the highest-leverage windows to start dedicated speed training.
  </p>
